    narr:narration """The decision to migrate the analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB is presented as a settled technical transition, framed simultaneously by [direct operational intent](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787834607681_1) and [formalized editorial summary](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787834607681_3). The justification for this shift rests on a dual-pillar argument of [performance efficiency](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787834607681_2) and [cost optimization](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787834607681_4), projecting a ten-fold increase in query speed. While the technical and economic rationale is treated as a present-tense reality, the [execution timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787834607681_5) remains anchored in the future, specifically Q3 2026, shifting the register from collaborative technical adoption to authoritative scheduling.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787834607681_1> ;
